{"version":1,"content":"<p>一款專門用於安全研究的人工智能模型近日發現了Java編程語言中存在的一系列安全漏洞，引發業界廣泛關注。Java作為甲骨文公司開發並維護的編程語言，被廣泛應用於航空公司、銀行、醫院以及政府機構等關鍵基礎設施系統中，因此此次發現被認為具有重要影響。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586998.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T20:44:25.130721+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T20:19:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T20:37:35.250847+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T20:37:35.250847+00:00","content_hash":"e8e187f207427205b80fd57b302b833fa61a9f20388ae2630528b5c316102a92","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}